        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"bf8292c1-d2e7-4b15-ae9f-511e8f006be5\",\"review_text\":\"I'm sorry, but why can't I find the lyrics of the songs? I have spotify premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9d2931c-91c3-4d22-ad64-89cab6c81ad9\",\"review_text\":\"I livee for spotify But ive been having a problem where my playlist will randomly freeze,and i cant skip,play or do anything with that playlist. I have to play another one. Edit:Fixed\"},{\"review_id\":\"98939944-71c8-4991-aabd-08e364438b26\",\"review_text\":\"It was good making playlist till they made it were you can NOT listen to the song when adding it to the playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"be0ec190-5ba1-4483-8479-60edb383db92\",\"review_text\":\"U still have time fix it or see some new app taking all your crowd.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2a42444f-5ed0-4b8d-9969-3033b652e25c\",\"review_text\":\"Latest update made it worse\"},{\"review_id\":\"98548f73-dc97-4e3e-94c5-c3fd867ea187\",\"review_text\":\"Cant even skip or forward the song , and cant even go back to the previous song... I dont think there are any features left for free users... Every feature is shifted to premium ... It used to be the best music app , but now , You lost an user ...☹️\"},{\"review_id\":\"c0aa0e99-40bb-420e-a867-1d3a4b7c90cf\",\"review_text\":\"Ok naman sya maganda,,,,,\"},{\"review_id\":\"62b971a4-cddb-4981-a16d-34e4dc5c58c0\",\"review_text\":\"why would u raise the prices? its not like the app got better\"},{\"review_id\":\"e60e12e5-a166-4a69-8836-c6576f984a7a\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad...😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff434191-87c8-4a76-a30a-de1591982192\",\"review_text\":\"Not working showing play list empty all the time\"}]}"
